        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSAT, Solid Brass Acorn Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Acorn finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last though years of continuous use. Available in an array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with  <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinges\"><b>Deltana Solid Brass Hinges</b></a> (except <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"> 6\" x 6\" Brass Hinge</a>).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Acorn Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 8mm x 1.25mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PVD Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><i>Sold Individually</i></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Acorn Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSAT",
                "description": "Deltana DSAT Acorn Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Acorn finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last though years of continuous use. Available in an array of finishes.<",
